# 默认按文本处理，显式声明二进制，避免 Git 误判/损坏
* text=auto eol=lf

*.woff2 binary
*.gif binary
*.png binary
*.mp4 binary
*.ico binary

# 生成产物：不计入语言统计，也不参与 diff 噪音
public/fonts/noto-sans-sc/*.woff2 linguist-generated=true
src/assets/fonts/*.b64 linguist-generated=true
package-lock.json linguist-generated=true
docs/demo.gif linguist-documentation=true

# 文档语言统计
*.md text
